cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "A13x: A Unified Pipeline Layer for Naming Conventions and Asset Validation in Maya"
abstract: >-
  A13x is an open-source Maya pipeline plug-in bundling six tools
  (GeoMaster, Nomenclator, ThumbTac, Revention, Substance Loader and Umbra)
  behind a single shelf, enforcing naming conventions, geometry validation,
  versioning, and texture correctness live inside the Maya scene graph.
